update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Residency split as printed in the Common Data Set (in-state 36,127 / out-of-state 4,739 / international 4,771 applicants). No early decision; early action closes Nov 1 with rolling notification. The Common Data Set reports average GPA on a 100-point scale (91.6), not 4.0, so the average GPA is not shown. SAT composite percentiles were not published (only ERW and Math); mean SAT 649 ERW / 654 Math, mean ACT 29. All applicants may choose to be considered test-optional.'
