update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Common Data Set 2024-2025 (fall 2024 entering class); the 2025-2026 edition was not posted on Columbus State''s Common Data Set page. Residency split (in-state / out-of-state / international): applicants 3,400 / 236 / 15, admits 3,370 / 232 / 15, enrolled 1,084 / 85 / 6; the extracted PDF layout was garbled, but each row sums exactly to the printed totals (3,651 / 3,617 / 1,175). The GPA breakdown is not shown because the column layout could not be read reliably; the average GPA of 3.18 is clearly printed. Only 13% submitted SAT and 12% ACT scores, so the score ranges describe a small self-selected group. The admission-factor checkboxes were unreadable and are not shown. No early decision or early action; no waitlist.'
from public.institutions i
