update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'The Common Data Set covers all campuses of the merged university (Bloomsburg, Lock Haven, Mansfield); figures are not split by campus. Fall 2025 first-year class. The residency split reports 13 international applicants, all 13 admitted and all 13 enrolled. Undergraduate enrollment is the ''Total Undergraduates'' column (9,488, including non-degree-seeking; nonresident 58). The Common Data Set says it is not an open-admission school; no early decision or early action. Only about a quarter of enrolled students submitted SAT scores, so the score percentiles describe that subgroup.'
