update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2024). Scorecard/IPEDS id 126562 covers CU Denver | Anschutz Medical Campus together; the undergraduate program and these figures are for the Denver (Auraria) campus, and the map point is the Denver campus, approximate, not the IPEDS location. Only 341 (23%) enrolled students submitted SAT and 31 (2%) ACT, so percentiles describe a small group. International applicants were admitted at about 34% (631 of 1,854); the Common Data Set shows no international first-years in the enrolled residency table although its enrollment table lists 68 nonresident first-time students. A 2025-26 Common Data Set was not found on the OIRE site. No waitlist; no early decision plan. Student-faculty ratio is 17 to 1 (fall 2024).'
