update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2025 entering class). Applicants = men 4,428 + women 7,337 + unknown 3 (the Common Data Set''s total cell was left at 0); admitted 10,174 (86.5%); enrolled 1,001. Admits by residency: Texas 8,951, other states 926, international 165, unknown 132. International enrolled first-years: 43. International applicants were not reported, so no international admit rate is shown. College Navigator shows 8,455 applicants / 84% admitted for fall 2024. 254 enrollees (25.37%) sent SAT scores and 41 (4.10%) sent ACT scores. For GPA, 93.31% reported, average 3.43. Undergraduate enrollment (3,277) and nonresident count (143) are the ''Total Undergraduates'' figures (all students, including part-time and non-degree). Student-faculty ratio 17:1 (3,742 students, 215 faculty).'
