update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2025): 3,951 men + 7,322 women applied, 2,858 + 5,398 were admitted, 1,641 enrolled (full- and part-time). The college did not report the in-state / out-of-state / international split of applicants and admits, so international applicant and admit counts are not available. No early decision or early action. Only 76 enrolled students sent SAT scores (4.6%), so the SAT percentiles rest on a small group. Undergraduate enrollment is 9,028 (total); international undergraduates number 231 (counted as nonresidents; IPEDS fall 2024 reports 373). The GPA breakdown is as printed (30.2% at 4.0). Test-optional; the admission-factor checkboxes are not readable in the PDF, so no factors are shown.'
