update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from IPEDS, the US government''s college data (fall 2023 entering class); no Common Data Set was found on Kean''s Institutional Research pages, so GPA, residency and international applicant splits are not available. College Navigator (fall 2024): 13,936 applicants, 76% admitted, 19% of admits enrolled. SAT/ACT percentiles are not shown because only about 1% of enrolled first-years sent SAT scores (10 students in fall 2023). Undergraduate enrollment 11,234 and 682 nonresident-alien undergraduates are IPEDS fall 2023 (full-time plus part-time). Kean merged with New Jersey City University on July 1, 2026; these figures predate the merger.'
from public.institutions i
