update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from IPEDS, the US government''s college data (fall 2024 entering class); applicants, admits and enrollees are the exact IPEDS totals (enrolled = full-time 143 + part-time 3). College Navigator shows the same 1,976 applicants, 76% admitted and 10% of admits enrolled. No Common Data Set could be found on La Roche''s site or by search, so GPA, international applicant counts and in-state/out-of-state splits are not available. SAT/ACT percentiles are for enrolled first-time students, and scores are optional, so only students who chose to send them are included: SAT 21 students, ACT only 5 students.'
