update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from IPEDS, the US government''s college data (fall 2023 entering class); Longwood''s Common Data Set page lists files only through 2019-2020, so no recent Common Data Set was used. College Navigator also shows fall 2024: 5,391 applicants, 90% admitted (exact admit count not given), SAT EBRW 530/580/630 and Math 500/540/580 for 205 students who sent scores (25%). Longwood''s admission-requirements page prints ''accepted students at a glance'' (undated): mid-range GPA 3.35-4.02, SAT 1040-1230, ACT 21-27. ACT percentiles are not listed because only 23 enrolled students (3%) sent ACT scores in fall 2023. International applicant and admit counts, GPA breakdown and SAT total are not available from IPEDS.'
from public.institutions i
