update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from IPEDS, the US government''s college data, via College Navigator (fall 2024 entering class); no readable Common Data Set: Millersville''s Common Data Set page says its PDFs were taken offline for accessibility and must be requested from ir@millersville.edu. College Navigator prints only rounded percentages (86% admitted, 18% of admitted enrolled), not the admit and enrolled counts. International applicant counts, GPA and class-rank splits are not available. SAT percentiles are from the 221 enrolled first-years who submitted SAT (18%); ACT percentiles are not published. Undergraduate enrollment and student-faculty ratio (19 to 1) are College Navigator figures. The applicant, admit and enrolled counts are the exact IPEDS figures for fall 2023, because the newer source gives only a rounded admit rate.'
