update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2025): 4,595 men + 5,493 women + 1 unknown applied, 4,379 + 5,324 + 1 admitted, 4,280 enrolled (1,996 men + 2,284 women). The in-state / out-of-state / international split of applicants and admits (residency table) is blank, so international applicant and admit counts are not available; the Common Data Set counts 56 nonresident first-time first-year students enrolled. Undergraduate enrollment is the total (19,321); the number of international undergraduates is the nonresident total (270). No waitlist; no early decision or early action. SAT composite 25/50/75 = 1010/1100/1200 (ERW 510/560/620, Math 480/540/590); ACT composite 18/21/25. The fall 2025 admit rate is about 96%; current bachelor''s admission routes (GPA-only or freshman index) are in the test policy.'
