update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2024 entering class): 2,011 applied, 1,998 admitted (99.4%), 664 enrolled (592 in-state, 57 out-of-state, 15 international). The Common Data Set gives no international applicant or admit counts. IPEDS College Navigator reports 1,727 applicants and 100% admitted for fall 2024, which differs from the Common Data Set. NSU''s 2025-2026 Common Data Set Excel file was also posted but is incomplete and internally inconsistent (admits exceed applicants, SAT and cost sections blank), so the 2024-2025 Common Data Set is used. Open-style admission with rolling decisions; no early decision or early action, no waitlist. The Common Data Set reports ACT scores only (84.6% submitted; no SAT percentiles; College Navigator shows 4% submitted the SAT). Undergraduate enrollment is 5,085 and the nonresident count is 189 (''Total Undergraduates'' figures, fall 2024).'
