update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Fall 2023 entering class from the Common Data Set (applicants 3,332 men + 6,137 women + 10 another gender; admits 3,077 + 5,803 + 0; enrolled 373 + 856). UNC''s newer 2024-25 Common Data Set is an image-only PDF whose text could not be read, so the 2023-24 Common Data Set is used. The Common Data Set withholds the residency split of applicants and admits, so no international admit rate is shown (nonresidents were 103 of 6,616 undergraduates in fall 2023). College Navigator (IPEDS fall 2024) shows 11,127 applicants and an 86% admit rate. Undergraduate enrollment (6,480) and student-faculty ratio (14:1) are from College Navigator, fall 2024.'
