update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from IPEDS, the US government''s college data (fall 2024 entering class; 85% admitted). Ohio University''s 2025 Common Data Set exists only as a view-only SharePoint spreadsheet (download disabled) and its earlier Common Data Set files are marked under review for a calculation error in one section, so no Common Data Set was used. International applicants/admits, GPA and residency splits are therefore not available (IPEDS does not publish them). SAT/ACT percentiles are from IPEDS fall 2023: 12% of enrolled first-years submitted SAT and 36% submitted ACT; ACT English 21/24/28 and ACT Math 20/24/26 (25th/50th/75th). Undergraduate enrollment is fall 2024 (20,444); the number of international undergraduates is not shown.'
