update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2024 first-year class): 40,021 applied, 35,337 admitted (88%), 5,087 enrolled (full-time plus part-time). Oregon did not report the residency breakdown (in-state, out-of-state, international), so no international admit rate is shown; the Common Data Set lists 40 degree-seeking nonresident undergraduates with institutional aid. The GPA breakdown is the ''all enrolled students'' column. SAT/ACT figures cover the 8% (SAT, 412 students) and 5% (ACT, 272 students) of enrollees who submitted scores; Oregon is test-optional. The admission factor check boxes could not be read reliably, so factors are omitted. The cost table in the Common Data Set is labelled 2024-25 and was not used; costs come from the financial aid office.'
