update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set 2023-24 (fall 2023 entering class; the newest Common Data Set Rutgers has posted for Newark, with no 2024-25 or 2025-26 edition found). International: 2,211 applied, 1,550 admitted (70%), 29 enrolled. Newark did not report SAT/ACT percentiles or GPA in the Common Data Set; no waitlist policy; no early decision. College Navigator (IPEDS fall 2024) shows 36,793 applicants and 71% admitted, a much larger applicant count than the Common Data Set, so the Common Data Set figures are the ones shown. Enrollment (7,989 undergraduates) and student-faculty ratio (14:1) are College Navigator fall 2024; the Common Data Set has 7,417 and 13:1 for fall 2023.'
