update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Fall 2023 first-years from the 2023-24 Common Data Set, the newest edition readable as text: the 2024-25 and 2025-26 Common Data Set PDFs are on a Google Drive link (the 2025-26 one asks for a sign-in; the 2024-25 one has numbers that cannot be extracted as text), so they were not used. Residency table from the Common Data Set: in-state 2,873 applied / 2,650 admitted / 421 enrolled, out-of-state 898 / 783 / 66, international 518 / 370 / 16; total 4,289 / 3,803 / 503. The GPA breakdown is the ''all enrolled students'' column as printed; average GPA is printed to one decimal (3.6). SAT/ACT percentiles, the share of students who sent scores and the admission factor checkboxes could not be extracted as text, so they are not shown. College Navigator fall 2024 (newer): 5,175 applicants, 87% admitted, 9% of admitted enrolled; undergraduate enrollment 1,954 and student-faculty ratio 10:1 are from College Navigator fall 2024. Saint Mary''s is test-optional.'
