update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from IPEDS, the US government''s college data (fall 2023 entering class). College Navigator''s fall 2024 figures: 7,287 applicants, 98% admitted, 34% of admitted enrolled; ACT composite 19/22/25 (75% submitted), SAT ERW 530/570/610, SAT Math 530/560/630 (2% submitted). SDSU''s only readable public Common Data Set is 2021-22 (newer years are listed but not linked), so GPA, residency and international applicant splits are not added. IPEDS reported no international first-year applicants. Undergraduate enrollment 10,177 and 307 nonresident-alien undergraduates are from IPEDS (fall 2023).'
