update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2025 first-year class): it states an open admission policy for all students (virtually every applicant who completes the application is admitted). The Common Data Set gives no residency or international split for applicants/admits. College Navigator (IPEDS fall 2024) counts differently: 19,080 applicants, 82% admitted, 14% of admits enrolled. No early decision; early action is rolling with no closing date. No waitlist. SUU does not use SAT/ACT in admission decisions (the Common Data Set answers No) and reported no score percentiles. Total undergraduates are 13,176 including part-time and non-degree students; 749 nonresident (international) undergraduates (621 degree-seeking). The fall 2025 first-year class has 127 nonresident students.'
