update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set, first-time, first-year totals (applied 8,936; admitted 8,442 = 3,603 men + 4,839 women; enrolled 1,293). The 2025-26 Common Data Set does not report international applicants or admits, GPA, or SAT/ACT composite percentiles, so those are not shown; the cell for applied-by-sex printed as a spreadsheet error but the totals are given. Undergraduate enrollment is 6,790 (''Total all undergraduates''); the number of international undergraduates is the nonresident count among degree-seeking undergraduates (27). Only 2 of the 1,293 first-year students were nonresidents. No waitlist, no early decision/early action.'
