update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (Fall 2024; the 2025-2026 edition was not posted on Tarleton''s Common Data Set page). International: 33 applied, 30 admitted, 12 enrolled (residency table). Undergraduate enrollment and the 79 nonresident undergraduates are totals (15,130 incl. non-degree). SAT composite 970/1060/1150 is also published (not shown on this page). Tarleton did not report the GPA table or the average GPA, and all the admission-factor checkboxes are marked, so no factors are shown. The enrolled figure from the applications and admissions section (3,018) is higher than the degree-seeking first-time count from the enrollment section (2,581); the first figure is shown as printed.'
