update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2025 entering class); the residency split comes from its residency table (in-state 14,512 / out-of-state 24,878 / international 3,434 applicants; 12,641 / 21,812 / 2,469 admitted; 3,339 / 1,779 / 185 enrolled). Undergraduate enrollment and the nonresident count are the ''Total Undergraduates'' figures (21,031; 891 nonresidents). Nonbinding early action (closes 11/1, notified 1/10); no early decision. The GPA table is blank in the Common Data Set, so the average GPA and the GPA breakdown are not shown. The SAT middle 50% is for the 19% (1,000 students) who submitted; ACT was submitted by 1% (76 students). Temple is test optional.'
