update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set for fall 2025 (TSU''s 2025-26 files are headed ''Common Data Set 2024-2025'' but ask for Fall 2025 data): 8,804 applied, 7,451 admitted (85%), 457 enrolled. International: 84 applied, 81 admitted (96%), 4 enrolled. The GPA breakdown is the ''all enrolled students'' column. The shares who sent scores come from the Common Data Set percentages (138 SAT, 307 ACT of the 457 enrolled). Admission factors: academic GPA and test scores very important, rigor and class rank considered, everything else not considered (the x marks were readable). Undergraduate enrollment is 4,221 and there are 74 nonresident undergraduates (fall 2025); the student-to-faculty ratio of 11 to 1 is from the Common Data Set (College Navigator shows 13 to 1).'
from public.institutions i
