update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (fall 2025 first-year class): 7,804 applied, 7,536 admitted, 1,502 enrolled. TWU did not report the in-state / out-of-state / international split, so international applicants and admits are not published. Undergraduate enrollment is 9,962 and nonresident undergraduates number 161 (both ''Total Undergraduates'' figures); the student-to-faculty ratio (16:1) is the fall 2024 College Navigator figure. TWU is coeducational but 8,790 of its 9,962 undergraduates are women. No waiting list, early decision or early action. TWU is test-optional, so SAT percentiles describe the 48% (SAT) and 8% (ACT) of enrollees who submitted scores; no ACT percentiles were reported. The PDF header says ''Common Data Set 2024-2025'' but its data are for fall 2025 and it is posted as the 2025-2026 edition. The admission-factor checkboxes could not be read from the PDF text, so no factors are shown.'
