update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from IPEDS, the US government''s college data, via College Navigator (fall 2024 entering class); no Common Data Set could be found on UNCG''s institutional research site. College Navigator reports an 89% admit rate, so an admit count from it would only be approximate (12,948 x 0.89); it gives no enrolled count, only ''percent admitted who enrolled'', 21%. Only 48 enrollees sent SAT scores and 232 sent ACT scores, so the score percentiles describe a small group. SAT total, GPA, residency/international splits are not available. Applicant, admit and enrolled counts are the exact IPEDS figures for fall 2023, because the newer source gives only a rounded admit rate.'
from public.institutions i
