update public.admission_stats t set notes = 'Figures from the Common Data Set (fall 2025 entering class). International: 609 applied, 460 admitted (76%), 44 enrolled; overall admit rate 88%. The Common Data Set also lists 5 applicants/admits of unknown residency. Early decision: the Common Data Set answers No, but the admissions site now lists an Early Decision round (see Wentworth''s deadlines). No waitlist. The GPA breakdown is the ''all enrolled students'' column. 22% of enrollees sent SAT scores and 2% sent ACT scores (test-optional). Undergraduate enrollment is 4,182 (total undergraduates); international undergraduates number 171 (total nonresident-alien undergraduates).'
