update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Costs from the Common Data Set (2024-2025 edition, which lists 2025-2026 costs). Transportation varies and is not included in other costs. The Common Data Set reports 2024-2025 aid to nonresidents: non-need-based aid from the college only; 20 awarded (need- or non-need-based), average $39,634. Boston College did not report the interview row of the admission factors, so it is not shown; BC is unable to provide need-based financial aid to students who are not US citizens or permanent residents; international students should expect to pay full cost. Merit aid for international students is not described on the international page; the 2024-2025 Common Data Set reports non-need-based aid from the college to 20 nonresident undergraduates. Gabelli Presidential Scholars merit program exists (eligibility for international applicants not confirmed).'
