update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'From the Common Data Set (2025-2026). Other costs are $1,455 (other expenses); transportation ($630 for residents) is separate and not included. BU offers nonresident undergraduates its own non-need-based aid only (need-based aid is not available); the 231 recipients and the $56,639 average cover all nonresident degree-seeking undergraduates awarded need-based or non-need-based aid; BU Financial Assistance does not offer need-based University scholarship or grant aid to international students (except through select partner organizations). International first-year applicants are considered for merit scholarships; apply for admission by December 1 for scholarship consideration. The Common Data Set for 2025-2026 also lists non-need-based aid only for nonresidents.'
