update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'BGSU international estimate for 2026-27 at 12 credits: tuition and fees combined $23,500, room and meals $12,500, insurance and books $3,500 (total $39,500). The international tuition figure includes required fees. Falcon Tuition Guarantee locks tuition for four years; aviation flight technology costs more. An international student services fee applies each fall and spring (amount not stated on the page); Automatic merit scholarships for international students (no separate application; requires a complete admission application and, for the academic award, SAT/ACT or TOEFL/IELTS-type scores). BG Success Scholarship $4,000/year for all international freshmen and transfers with GPA 3.0+, renewable four years. Freshman Academic Scholarship $1,000 to $8,000/year by GPA and test scores (estimates: $1,000 at GPA 3.0-3.19 with SAT 1050/ACT 21 or TOEFL 71-80; $3,000 at GPA 3.2-3.49, SAT 1160/ACT 25; $5,000 at GPA 3.5-3.69, SAT 1260/ACT 28; $8,000 at GPA 3.7-4.0, SAT 1380/ACT 31). To be considered for fall 2026 the page said apply by June 20, 2026; the fall 2027 date is not yet posted.'
