update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Computed from Fall 2026 published rates: tuition $3,419 per semester (6.1+ units) twice, plus the nonresident charge of $471 per unit for an assumed 30 units a year ($14,130). Required fees $1,052 per semester twice (ASB 249, Health Facility 3, Health Service 207.75, IRA 91.25, RunnerPass 6, Student Body 468, Campus Programming 25, Student Involvement 2). Housing, food, books and insurance not added because no international budget was found; spring 2027 fees were assumed equal to fall 2026; The CSUB international undergraduate pages checked list no scholarships or financial aid for international applicants (scholarships are mentioned only as sponsor types for financial documents). No conditional-admission or ESL pathway is described on these pages; confirm with CSUB International Student Programs.'
