update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Computed from the official 2026-27 fee schedule: undergraduate tuition $3,419 per semester (6.1+ units) twice, plus the nonresident charge of $471 per unit for an assumed 30 units a year ($14,130). Required fees: $936.36 in fall and $931.36 in spring ($1,867.72, rounded). CSUDH''s own international budget on the Financial Certification page totals $38,292 but uses an older $396 per unit nonresident rate and states no year, so it is not used; The Financial Certification page states there are no scholarships or financial aid available at CSUDH to international students; limited on-campus work only. Conditional admission through ALCP (American Language and Culture Program) is for applicants who meet all other requirements but not the English score; ALCP charges a $55 fee to CSUDH plus a $150 CSUDH Foundation fee, the page does not guarantee admission, and program tuition is not stated.'
