update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Tuition $3,419 per semester (6.1+ units), $6,838 a year, and campus fees $2,349 a year are from CSUMB''s 2026-27 tuition and fees page. The page gives no nonresident per-unit rate, so nonresident tuition is not shown. CSUMB''s international page (2025-2026 estimate, not updated) shows nonresident tuition and campus fees of $19,200 at 12 units per semester, living expenses $17,448, personal expenses and books $5,038 and mandatory health insurance $1,700, for a total of $43,386; CSUMB says it offers limited institutional scholarships for international students (CSUMB International Student Scholarship, applied for at csumb.academicworks.com); the how-to-apply page says they help waive the non-resident portion of tuition. No award amounts are published. Conditional admission: apply to the American Language and Culture Program (ALCP, levels 1 to 4) and indicate interest; it does not guarantee admission to a degree program and no program cost was found on the pages checked.'
