update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'First-year costs for 2026-27 from the Common Data Set (the in-state figure is the instructional fee). The Common Data Set lists one nonresident rate, shown here as international tuition; UC''s international web page only shows outdated 2022-23 costs. In the Common Data Set, 958 nonresidents received non-need-based institutional aid, average $14,548; UC does not offer full-tuition or need-based scholarships to undergraduate international students. The International Outreach Award is $5,000-$15,000 per year (Uptown/Main campus; $2,000-$4,000 at regional campuses), needs a 3.0+ unweighted GPA, is applied to the non-resident surcharge only and is renewable for up to 8 semesters. It is reviewed automatically from the admission application.'
