update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'First-year costs from the Common Data Set: tuition $69,207, required fees $2,318, food and housing $20,920; books $1,005, transportation $608 + other $2,040 (shown together as other costs, 608 + 2,040). The Common Data Set''s tuition and fees checkbox says 2026-27 costs are ''not available'' yet values are filled in, so the year label follows the Common Data Set prompt. Need-based institutional aid is available to nonresidents; 483 awarded, average $87,562, total $42,292,307; Need-blind for international applicants since the Class of 2026; meets 100% of demonstrated need regardless of citizenship. CSS Profile (school code 3351) required for international applicants; the ISFAA is accepted if the Profile fee is a hardship. No merit scholarships are mentioned on the pages read.'
