update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'First-year costs from the Common Data Set (''other'' is the resident-student figure). Tuition and fees are flat per year under the university''s guaranteed tuition plan; the university cost page for 2025-26 shows a slightly different non-resident tuition-and-fees total ($22,266 vs $22,176 here). The Common Data Set says institutional need-based and non-need-based aid are both available to nonresidents; 24 received it (average $9,622, total $230,923); The Common Data Set says institutional need-based and non-need-based aid are both available to degree-seeking nonresident undergraduates (24 recipients, average $9,622). The international admissions page describes no scholarship amounts, and the cost page lists no non-resident tuition waiver.'
