update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'College Navigator 2024-25: tuition shown includes required fees; total cost of attendance is the on-campus out-of-state figure ($28,055 in-state). EIU''s international page says international students are budgeted at regular out-of-state rates. Fall 2026 figures are not yet in College Navigator; EIU''s own 2026-27 cost calculator is interactive and was not used; New first-year and transfer international undergraduates are eligible for an International Scholar Award of $1,000 per fall and spring semester ($2,000/yr; up to $8,000 over four years for first-years) with no minimum GPA. An International Excellence Award assesses tuition at the in-state rate for undergraduates with a 3.5 GPA (4.0 scale) at admission. A competitive International Student Scholarship (partial tuition, 3.00 GPA, based on need and/or academic excellence) is also offered. EIU also charges a $230 international student fee per academic year.'
