update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'FDU international estimate for 2026-27: tuition, fees and medical insurance $42,799 plus room and board $17,000 = $59,799; excludes books and personal expenses. The $42,799 figure combines tuition, fees and medical insurance and is not split on the page; College Navigator 2024-25 for full-time beginning undergraduates living on campus; tuition includes required fees. Current international estimate is in the cycle file; FDU International Scholarship of up to $24,000 per year for first-year international students, based on academic merit, SAT/ACT not required, renewable up to four years, awarded at admission. Global Housing Grant $3,000 (Metropolitan campus residents). Conditional admission through the Pre-University Program (one semester, English for Professional Success courses; TOEFL 50, IELTS 5, Duolingo 80, PTE-A 45) is available to students below the direct English requirement.'
