update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'College Navigator 2024-25: tuition and fees combined $29,900; on-campus food and housing $15,130; books and supplies $1,260; total on-campus estimate $50,442. The international FAQ says international students pay the same costs as U.S. citizens plus a required health insurance policy (amount not published). 2026-27 prices were not found; International FAQ: only merit-based and athletic aid are available to international students; no separate application for merit scholarships and no amounts are published.'
