update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Rates for Fall 2026-Spring 2027 on the tuition page: Maryland resident tuition $7,640, out-of-state tuition $23,306, fees $3,138, housing and meals $15,242 (depends on accommodation). The page lists no separate international rate (international students are non-residents, so the out-of-state rate is the one that can apply, but this is not stated). Regional rate $17,198 is for residents of nearby PA/VA/WV/OH counties only; Federal aid is not available to international students. Admissions merit scholarships screen all incoming first-year students automatically, but the online merit calculator says awards for international students are not included, so international merit eligibility is unconfirmed. The Harold R. Rowe International Student Scholarship (GPA 2.5+, preference for financial need; deadlines July 1 for fall and October 15 for spring) is open to enrolled or accepted full-time international students; no amount is published.'
