update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance; Aid goes to a small number of admitted international applicants; financial need may affect admission chances. HMC states it can meet 100% of demonstrated need for only a handful of international students. Students who enter without aid are not considered for aid later. Merit: the So International Scholarship (one recipient per entering class, offered regardless of need, no separate application); international students may also apply for some merit awards.'
