update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Tuition $20,950 per semester (12-18 credits, traditional undergraduate, fall 2026/spring 2027); student fee $250 per semester; room is a first-year double ($3,742 per semester) plus default Meal Plan II ($2,835 per semester). Books are the College Navigator 2024-25 estimate. A total cost of attendance is not published on the pages reviewed, so none is given; International undergraduate scholarships are based on previous-school GPA converted to a U.S. 4.0 scale and are calculated automatically after the application and documents are in; the tuition page says up to $18,000 per year for full-time students at the Romeoville campus (the international overview says ''$17K maximum''). Lewis says merit scholarships are awarded regardless of citizenship. No need-based aid for international students is described; Mpower no-cosigner loans are available.'
from public.institutions i
