update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Annual undergraduate tuition (24-36 credits) $41,874; full-time university fee $2,116; standard double room $12,384 plus Residential Meal Plan One $6,554 (housing and food is their sum); student health insurance charge $2,158 and $150 dining dollars are listed separately. Same rates apply to international students. College Navigator lists books at $2,000 (2024-25); LIU FAQ: international students are eligible for merit-based scholarships and are automatically reviewed by the admissions committee at admission. No award amounts are published for international freshmen; scholarships apply to tuition only and are renewable subject to a GPA minimum. Federal and state aid are not available to international students; whether any institutional need-based aid exists for them is not stated.'
