update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'College Navigator (IPEDS) 2024-25: tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance for out-of-state students is $51,460. UofL''s own international cost-of-attendance page was not read, so current-year figures may differ; Global Cardinal Scholarship for first-time international freshmen (F-1), applied automatically on admission, per year: $5,000 (3.25-3.49 GPA), $6,500 (3.5-3.74), $8,000 (3.75+); GPA is converted to a 4-point scale. UofL''s out-of-state admissions scholarships are not available to F-1 students. Need-based aid for internationals is not mentioned.'
from public.institutions i
