update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Marian''s tuition page for 2026/2027: full-time (12-19 hours) $21,700 per semester ($43,400 per year), room and board $15,040, book estimate $1,200 per year. The page''s total on-campus cost is $58,440 (tuition plus room and board); the page does not state other expenses, so no total cost of attendance is recorded. Fall 2027 rates are not yet published; The international admissions page says international students may qualify for academic, talent, athletic and faith-based scholarships. Marian Scholars awards of $8,000 to $18,000 per year are applied at admission for a cumulative GPA of 2.75 or higher (first-year scholarships page; it does not say whether international students are included). International need-based aid is not described.'
