update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'From the Fall 2026/Spring 2027 table at 15 credit hours, doubled: in-state tuition $2,640 per semester; out-of-state total $10,631 and out-of-country total $10,916 per semester, each including $431 of mandatory fees (so tuition $10,200 and $10,485). Fees can be lower at Dublin, Eastman or Warner Robins (recreation fee $90). Housing and meal costs were not collected, so they are not shown; The international scholarship (new fall international students, 3.0 high school GPA, statement of purpose, deadline May 1) can waive up to half of the out-of-state tuition differential and is renewable for up to 4 years with a 2.5 cumulative GPA. Awards are competitive; the out-of-state waiver page says waivers are limited and first come, first served, with no dollar amounts printed.'
from public.institutions i
