update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'International estimated annual proof-of-funding for 2026-2027: tuition and fees $17,620 (includes some mandatory fees; 12-18 credits per semester), living expenses $13,890, health insurance $750, books and miscellaneous $1,400, total $33,660. A separate $150 per semester international student fee ($300 per year) is charged in addition and is not in that total; College Navigator estimated expenses 2024-2025 (tuition and fees; on-campus food and housing). Superseded for international students by the cycle-file international cost; Millersville''s admissions-scholarships page lists an ''International Scholarships'' contact (717-871-7506, international@millersville.edu). Award names and amounts could not be confirmed: the international financial-assistance page was unreachable (404) when checked, so scholarship amounts are not shown. Confirm with International Admissions.'
from public.institutions i
