update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'International bachelor cost page (9-month year; the page does not name the year, final figures are posted each July): tuition and fees $21,013 without the International Maverick Scholarship ($13,137 with it); housing and food $13,658; other $7,500 = $200 orientation fee + $1,500 books + $3,300 health insurance + $2,500 personal. Total $42,171 without / $34,295 with the scholarship. The page advises budgeting for at least an 8% increase; All degree-seeking international bachelor''s students automatically receive the International Maverick Scholarship unless they opt out; it cuts estimated tuition and fees from $21,013 to $13,137 (a $7,876 difference). The cost page does not list the renewal requirements.'
from public.institutions i
