update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'College Navigator (IPEDS 2024-25): one tuition-and-fees price for all students ($39,345, no in-state split); room and board $13,400 on campus; total on-campus cost of attendance $55,955. These are 2024-25 figures; the current tuition page lists 2026-27 rates in a layout that could not be read reliably; No international-specific scholarship found, and the pages do not say whether international students qualify for the freshman merit awards. Listed first-year merit awards (2025-26 page): Trustees'' $25,000, Presidential $22,000, Dean''s $20,000, Achievement Award $18,000, NU Grant $15,000 per year, based on transcript and/or test scores; total merit cannot exceed 75% of tuition and fees. Federal and NY state aid require citizenship or residency. Conditional admission (English pathway program such as Embassy English, C1 level) is described in Niagara''s undergraduate catalog per a search excerpt; the catalog page itself could not be read, so confirm with admissions.'
