update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Olivet cost-of-attendance table, on campus, 2026-27: tuition $41,450, general fee $990, housing and meals $12,290, books $920, plus transportation $725, personal $3,400 and loan fees $59 = $60,604 total (2025-26: $58,894). Same figures are listed for all students; health insurance premium for international students is extra and not published on these pages; The international page says ''Limited financial assistance may be available for international students'' and gives no amounts. Domestic first-year Academic Scholarship ($19,000-$28,500) and Academic Grant ($12,500-$21,500, minimum GPA 2.0) exist; the pages do not say whether international students qualify. Federal aid is not available to international students.'
