update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Estimated 2026-27 direct-bill full-time tuition and mandatory fees: $15,444 NH resident, $26,872 out-of-state; room and meals $14,008 (double room, unlimited meal plan). Rates are not final until the June 2026 board meeting. The page lists no separate international rate; the scholarship table groups international students with out-of-state students; Every admitted student is considered for GPA-based merit scholarships, assigned at the time of admission and renewable up to eight semesters. Fall 2027 entry (out-of-state/NEBHE/international, per year): 4.0+ Chancellor $16,000; 3.75-3.99 Presidential $15,000; 3.25-3.74 Deans $14,000; 2.75-3.24 Aspire $13,000; 2.50-2.74 Promise $9,000; 2.25-2.49 Achieve $5,000; below 2.24 Strive $3,000. Plus a $2,000 on-campus housing scholarship. Whether need-based aid exists for international students is not stated.'
