update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'College Navigator 2024-25: tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance for New Jersey residents ($57,528 total at the out-of-state tuition rate); Rutgers-Camden''s International Chancellor''s Scholarship goes to nonsponsored F-1 first-year and transfer students with no separate application. The two Camden pages disagree on size: the scholarships page says ''up to $17,000 per year'', while the dedicated scholarship page lists weighted-GPA tiers for first-years (2.8-3.19: $16,000; 3.2-3.69: $18,000; 3.7-4.0: $21,000 per year), renewable with a 2.5 GPA; confirm the current amount with the office. The scholarships page also lists a #YouAreWelcomeHere Scholarship covering a minimum of 50% of tuition for first-year international students. No need-based aid for international students is described.'
