update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Computed from the Bursar page: tuition $3,419 per semester (6+ units) twice, campus fees $1,409 per semester twice, and the nonresident tuition fee of $471 per unit for an assumed 30 units ($14,130). Living on campus $20,212, books $1,240, transportation $1,528 plus personal $3,808 (other). The Bursar page has no F-1 budget; health insurance is not included; Sacramento State''s scholarships page says the Scholarships Office awards nearly $4 million a year but does not say whether international students are eligible and names no awards. Contact scholarshipfaqs@csus.edu. No conditional-admission or ESL pathway is described on the pages checked, although its English Language Institute (Level 7) counts as English proof.'
