update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Full-time tuition $14,325 per quarter ($42,975 for three quarters, 15 credit hours). $125 annual student health fee (Savannah campus); mandatory international student health insurance $1,417 for Sept. 1, 2026 - Aug. 31, 2027. Housing in Savannah about $10,065-$18,849 per year plus a $750 application fee; meal plans $1,575-$6,750 per year (not summed into a room and board figure). One-time $500 enrollment fee and $100 application fee; International students are not eligible for U.S. federal or state aid. Every admitted student is automatically reviewed for institutional scholarships (Academic, Achievement, Honors with a 3.5+ GPA or outstanding portfolio, Distinguished Scholars by nomination), and an International Student Scholarship needs a 500-word essay. Funds are limited and go to the earliest qualifiers; amounts are not published on the pages reviewed. Awards renew with a 3.0 GPA.'
