update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'SCSU international costs page (updated 2025-07-25, 9 months): tuition with the Academic and Cultural Sharing Scholarship (ACSS) $11,258; tuition and fees without it $21,384 ($19,910 tuition + $1,474 fees); room and board $10,970; insurance, books and supplies $5,476. The page''s I-20 total WITH ACSS is $29,178; $37,830 here is the sum of the published no-scholarship lines; Academic and Cultural Sharing Scholarship (ACSS) lowers international undergraduate tuition (about $8,652 per year on the costs page; renewable each semester with a 2.5 GPA and cultural-sharing activities). The costs page says students opt in at orientation; other SCSU pages describe it as applied automatically to the first semester. Need-based awards depend on FAFSA, which international students cannot file.'
