update public.cost_aid t set notes = '2025-26 catalog: full-time undergraduate flat tuition $17,277 per semester (12-18 credits), so $34,554 per year; the same rate is shown for 2026 programs. Fees, room and board vary by hall and meal plan (for example a double room $4,030-$4,150 per semester and a 14-meal plan $2,825 per semester), so a single room-and-board figure is not shown. College Navigator 2024-25 lists food and housing of $13,210; New international undergraduates get automatic GPA-based scholarships: up to $13,000 (GPA above 3.6), up to $11,000 (3.0-3.59), up to $9,000 (below 3.0). No separate application; STU says it does not offer 100% scholarships. Whether amounts are per year is not stated.'
