update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'International bachelor''s-degree table (per year): tuition $17,500, comprehensive fees $2,000, books/health insurance/travel/misc. $3,500, room and board $18,000, estimated cost $41,000 (the I-20 financial-support amount). The page prints no academic year, so it is assumed to be current; College Navigator 2024-25: tuition includes required fees; total is the on-campus cost of attendance for New York residents ($32,880 at the out-of-state rate). The tuition boxes in the Common Data Set are blank in the PDF. The published international cost table is listed separately; Accepted students (including international) can complete the general scholarship application, which opens October 1 and matches them to scholarships; amounts are not published. Need-based aid for international students is not mentioned, so it is left unconfirmed.'
