update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'Bursar table is per semester; annual figures are twice the printed amounts. Out-of-state/international full-time tuition $9,460 per semester ($7,070 a year for NY residents); mandatory fees $676 per semester (college, activity, athletic, health service, technology, transportation), plus a one-time $100-150 orientation fee. Room and board = Woodlands double $4,445 + Panther''s All-Access meal plan $3,225 per semester; the Tuition & Aid page shows $14,990, so confirm. Health insurance not included; Need-based aid is for U.S. citizens and permanent residents. No scholarship for incoming international students was found; the only international-related award seen is a study-abroad scholarship.'
