update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance; "Tulane University offers limited need-based financial assistance to international students"; submit the CSS Profile by 15 February. International students must also complete the Certification of Finances form in the Green Wave Portal. The page gives no aid amounts, does not say whether admission is need-aware, and has no merit-scholarship information, so need-aware with limited aid is the closest category rather than a confirmed policy. Tulane offers ''limited need-based financial assistance'' to international students; need-aware/need-blind status is not stated.'
