update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'First-year costs for 2025-26 from the Common Data Set: non-resident tuition $19,583 plus required fees $1,456. UHD has no on-campus housing; the housing and food figure is the estimate for commuters not living at home. The Common Data Set also lists transportation $3,016. College Navigator (2024-25) showed out-of-state tuition and fees $17,548 and out-of-state off-campus total cost of attendance $36,964; The international admissions pages list no scholarships for international students. UHD''s Competitive Scholarship Tuition Waiver can reduce non-resident and international tuition for students holding a competitive scholarship of at least $1,000 per term from a college or department scholarship committee. The nonresident aid section of the Common Data Set could not be read from the PDF text.'
