update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'UWM international cost page (2026-27, two semesters): nonresident tuition $22,247 plus segregated and international student fees $2,158; page estimate of $41,663 includes $15,000 living expenses (12 months) and $2,258 international health insurance (12 months). The Common Data Set (2024-25 aid) shows 152 degree-seeking nonresident undergraduates received institutional aid, average $4,117. A $200 International Student Processing Fee is due after admission; Newly admitted international degree-seeking undergraduates are automatically considered for an academic-merit scholarship of up to $6,000 per academic year ($3,000 per semester), renewable for up to four years; no separate application. The Common Data Set also ticks institutional need-based and non-need-based aid for nonresidents, but no international need-based program is described on the CIE page.'
from public.institutions i
