update public.cost_aid t set notes = 'From the Fall 2026 fee schedule, doubled for two semesters at 15 credit hours: out-of-country tuition $10,950 per semester, mandatory fees $818 per semester ($1,636 per year, matching the CDS). Room and board is the schedule''s minimum housing ($2,701, basic double room) plus the Blazer Weekly 8 meal plan ($1,658) per term; freshmen are listed on the Unlimited or 10-meal plans, so actual cost is higher. International students must buy the VSU health insurance (rate not read). The schedule estimates $33,454 for two semesters including $600 books per term; The international page says partial out-of-state tuition-waiver scholarships are available on a limited basis; contact the Center for International Programs. No amounts are published on the page read.'
from public.institutions i
