update public.programs t set notes = 'Fall 2027 entry. Common first year: apply on OUAC to ''Engineering I - Discovery Track'' or directly to the ''Engineering I - Mechanical Engineering Track'' (co-op available); the tool lists 11 direct-entry tracks. Data is taken from McMaster''s Admission Requirements tool (https://future.mcmaster.ca/requirements/admission-requirements/): program ''Engineering'' (B.Eng., B.Eng.Mgt., B.Eng.Society, B.Eng.Biosci.), ''Attending a School Outside Canada'', with the British-patterned, International Baccalaureate and American-style curriculum options; Ontario applicants'' anticipated range is min. 87%. Application deadline 15 Jan 2027 (recommended early 12 Nov 2026); supplementary application 28 Jan 2027 (recommended early 26 Nov 2026; details at eng.mcmaster.ca/supplementary-application); supporting documents including English test by 1 Apr 2027. Fee: the international fee of CAD 69354 is the 2026/2027 ''Estimated tuition'' (69353.54, full-time, tuition only, no ancillary fees) returned for ''Engineering I'', Non-Canadian/International Visa Student, by McMaster''s Cost Estimator (https://future.mcmaster.ca/finances/cost-estimator/), which the page calls unofficial estimates for 2026/2027; official schedule: https://registrar.mcmaster.ca/fees/undergraduate/. Not a Fall 2027 fee.'
